murdered |                                  <BR>| - 4/4: Brights attacked, Kathryn murdered  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1975 [Hatfill graduates Southwestern College] <BR>|  <BR>|     [Hatfill enlists in the Army] <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1976 [Hatfill washes out of Special Forces] <BR>|  <BR>|     [Hatfill marries] <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1977  <BR>|  <BR>| - 3/17: Vian murdered  <BR>|  <BR>|    [Hatfill&#39;s wife&#39;s father killed in battle in Angola or Zaire] <BR>|          &#40;april&#41; <BR> <BR>| - 12/8: Fox murdered  <BR> <BR>     [Hatfill discharged from Army] <BR> <BR>     [Hatfill marriage strained, leaves U.S..]  <BR> <BR>-1978  <BR>|     [Hatfill enrolls in medical school in Rhodesia] <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|     [Hatfill fails first year barrier exam, must repeat year] <BR>|  <BR>-1979 [Hatfills wife is still in U.S. filing for divorce and it is finalized two months into his studies &#40;May?&#41;] <BR>|  <BR>| - 4/28: Williams aborted attack  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1980 [Hatfill, Whilein medical school, worked as asst. medic forSelous Scouts would later claim major Role as combatant.] <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1981  <BR>.  <BR>.  <BR>.1983 [Hatfill flunks med school, freaks out, throws security guard through plate glass. The school alows him to retest after almost        having him arrested.] <BR>- <BR>.1984 [Hatfill graduates.]  <BR>.  <BR>-1986  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>| - 9/16: Wegerle murdered  <BR> <BR>|     [Hatfill leaves for 14 month stay in Antarctica &#40;December&#41;.] <BR>|  <BR>-1987  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1988  <BR>| - 1/88: Fager murder &#40;??&#41;  <BR>|  <BR>|   [Hatfill takes research job in South Afrika &#40;late in year&#41;] <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1989  <BR>.1993 [Hatfills research is discredited] <BR>.1994 [Hatfill takes job at Oxford, Eng] <BR>.1995 [Hatfill&#39;s credentials reviewed...many discrepancies] <BR> 1997 [Hatfill returns to U.S. Army Medical Research Institute of Infectious Diseases complex at Fort Detrick] <BR> 1999 [Hatfill takes job with Science Applications International Corporation &#40;SAIC&#41;.] <BR> 2000 [Hatfill accepted into the UNMOVIC weapons  inspections training program,] <BR> 2001 [Hatfill applied for a CIA contract requiring a high-level security clearance. Questioned about Africa. They don&#39;t buy        it.He is canned.] <BR> 2002 [Hatfill becomes POI in anthrax mailings, Fired. Fired again. Is voted Person most interesting in anthrax case by John Ashcroft    and is hounded by press and FBI, but they have no conclusive evidence so future hangs in limbo. Last seen holed up in girlfriend&#39;s apartment, unemployed.] <BR> 2003 [Hatfill lays low, FBI does not produce evidence, the anthrax scare blows over.] <BR> 2004 [BTK is back.] <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>{.... etc. etc. to present ....} <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
